              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "der Kamin — \"fireplace; chimney\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Im Winter sitzen wir abends vor dem Kamin. In winter we sit in front of the fire in the evenings."
            },
